WHAT IS NOT COVERED

- Everything under vendor/ belongs to its own authors and keeps its own
  licence: Stockfish 18 (GPL-3.0, see vendor/stockfish/Copying.txt),
  chess.js (BSD-2-Clause), cm-chessboard (MIT), marked (MIT).
  See vendor/VERSIONS.md. Nothing in this file adds to or takes away from
  those licences, and the vendored programs remain separate works.
- Chess move lists are facts and belong to nobody. The games are free to use;
  the annotations around them are not.
- Images that others made keep their makers' terms and are not licensed by
  this file: photographs from Wikimedia Commons and other public-domain or
  Creative Commons sources, and shigureni's illustrations
  (https://shigureni.com, used under their terms, which forbid redrawing them
  and any use with generative AI). Each one is credited in the lesson's
  sources block or in the manifest.json beside it.
- Quoted public-domain and Creative Commons material keeps the terms named in
  each lesson's sources block.

